# Desolace & Shen'dralas (43-43): the Horde quests of Desolace and of Shen'dralas, the WoW Forever
# zone south of the Valley of Bones, for a Horde duo.
#
# Built into the addon with:
#   python3 addon/tools/guide_build.py addon/guides/desolace_shendralas_43_43.guide --db data/forever.sqlite
#
# Research (November 2026): givers, objectives, prerequisites and the places of mobs and objects
# from the game data (data/forever.sqlite), checked against outof.games (Desolace, area 405;
# Shen'dralas, area 16651). The quest list is section 3 of addon/guides/horde_40_60_allocation.md.
#
# The centaur clans: the Gelkis and the Magram are enemies, every quest for one costs reputation
# with the other. Desolace (34-36) sides with the Gelkis and does their first quests: Carved Centaur
# Totems (93225), Buying Friendship: Gelkis (94873), Gelkis Alliance (1368), Stealing Supplies (1370)
# and Taiga's Hand of Iruxos (5381); it takes Ongeku (1373) and leaves it, and Stranglethorn Vale &
# Swamp of Sorrows (41-43) kills Ongeku for the Draenethyst Shard.
# Carried in: Ongeku (1373), handed in to Uthek the Wise here. Then the Gelkis chain of the Valley of
#   Bones: Valley of Bones (93034), Ravaging Ravagers (93035), Outing Outcasts (93037), Facing the
#   Truth (93041), Test Your Theory (93045), Saving Our Own (93058), Bone Burying (93062), Checking
#   Things Out (93122), Going Home (93125) and Khan Jehn (93128). Portals of the Legion (5581) and
#   Leather Technique (92817) open here, after 5381 and 1370.
# Test Your Theory (93045) follows A Cleansing Cry (93044) in the data, but A Cleansing Cry is an
#   Alliance quest (its race mask, and its outof.games page), while Test Your Theory and the
#   Horde-only Bone Burying, Checking Things Out and Going Home after it are Horde quests. The guide
#   takes 93045 right after Facing the Truth (after 93041); a tip covers Uthek offering A Cleansing Cry.
# Left out:
# - Khan Jehn (1374) and Khan Hratha for Uthek (1380): not in WoW Forever (no outof.games page; the
#   chain goes from Ongeku straight to Valley of Bones). Khan Jehn is 93128 here, Khan Hratha is
#   Umarak's 96222.
# - A Cleansing Cry (93044): Alliance only (see above).
# - The Magram chain: A Conqueror's Crown (92743) needs a crown from a crypt in the Badlands; Valley
#   of Bones (92841), Outcast Necromancers (92846), Mountain of Bones (92844), Corrupting Tears
#   (92847), Proof of Concept (92873), Bone Raising (92894), No Mercy for the Weak (92893), Bristleback
#   Retreat (93066), Long-Term Solutions (93072), Threat of Starvation (93129), Return to Orgrul
#   (93188) and Khan Jehn (93196) follow it. Khan Hratha for Warug (1381) and Buying Friendship:
#   Magram (94872) are the Magram side of the clan choice.
# - On the Lam (79235), Cherry for Your Thoughts? (79236), No Honor Among Thieves (79242): handed in
#   in Booty Bay and in the Arathi Highlands.
# - Abridged Notes on Draenethyst (93678): handed in to Magtoor in the Swamp of Sorrows.
# - Passing the Blame (93601) and Not on Squealing Terms (93606): they follow Rot and Regret
#   (Maraudon) and Agamaggan's Blood (Razorfen Downs), dungeon quests.
# Left out: Lost Shipping Crate (94895, a crate on the shore at Shadowprey Village): Friz
#   Frazzlespark takes it at Powderfuse Port in the Riverglades, which Riverglades (40-43) has left
#   by now, and no later guide goes back there (290 XP).
# The Corrupter (1488) follows Maurin Bonesplitter's Corrupter quests (1480-1484), which Desolace
# (34-36) does; its steps are for those who have it.
#
# The route: Orgrimmar (the auction house) and a flight to Shadowprey Village; Ghost Walker Post;
# the north (Kormek's Hut, Thunder Axe Fortress, Azore's tower); the Valley of Spears; the Gelkis
# Village; Mannoroc Coven, the Magram Village and Gimashi's tower; the Valley of Bones (Nerlokh) into
# Shen'dralas and its pylons; back across Desolace for the pylon pieces and the hand-ins, and Uthek's
# ritual by the pond; Nerlokh again, the temple's sieve, the captives, the bones and the pylons; the
# temple, the Outcast Hideaway, the gardens and the wilds; Nerlokh, Khan Jehn in the Magram Village
# and Uthek.

guide Desolace & Shen'dralas (43-43)
faction horde
levels 43 43
carry 243 1117 1137 1183 1261 1373 2864 2872 7068 93464 95033 95296
leave 243 1117 1137 1183 1261 2864 2872 7068 95033 95296
next Tanaris (43-43)

# Orgrimmar: the auction house ------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Orgrimmar
goto "Take the zeppelin to Orgrimmar and go into the city" at 50.0,60.0 r 60
note "Buy a Barbaric Harness at the auction house, for Talra of the Gelkis later (leatherworkers can make one)" npc 8673
tip It is cheap and rarely farmed; a Gelkis leatherworker asks for it in Desolace.
fly "Shadowprey Village, Desolace" npc 3310
tip No flight path to Shadowprey yet? Fly to Sun Rock Retreat in the Stonetalon Mountains and ride south-west into Desolace.

# Shadowprey Village ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Desolace
fpath 6726
bind 11106
accept 5581
tip Use the Hand of Iruxos at a portal of Mannoroc Coven once its guardian is dead.

# Ghost Walker Post ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------

accept 96222
tip Umarak, a Kolkar, stands east of the Gelkis Village.
accept 1488
tip Takata offers it after Maurin Bonesplitter's earlier Corrupter quests; skip its steps without it.
accept 6134
accept 79229
tip The burnt-out campsite is west of Ghost Walker Post.

