# The Valley of Spears --------------------------------------------------------------------------------

do 96222 at 29.6,52.0 "Get a War Horn Mouthpiece from the Maraudine centaurs, sound it on the highest peak and kill Khan Hratha"
tip The mouthpiece is a rare drop. Khan Hratha is elite; one summon is enough for both of you.
do 7068
tip The Shadowshard Rumblers and Smashers (level 40-42 elites) fill the caves outside the entrance of Maraudon, just west of the Valley of Spears: no need to enter the dungeon. They drop a fragment most of the time; each of you needs ten.
accept 6132
do 6132 at 34.0,53.5 "Escort Melizza Brimbuzzle out of the Valley of Spears"
tip Melizza runs east out of the valley; keep the centaurs off her.
turnin 6132
do 5501
tip The bones lie among the kodo skeletons of the graveyard.

